@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/pawn-first-phase-gas-move.puml
' purpose: first-phase marine gas already occupies — do not replan as a CC join
' status: OUTDATED — shipped; product = StarChess
' covers: packages/starchess-core/src/rules/specials/pawnDouble.ts
'         packages/starchess-core/src/ai/plans/stacks.ts
' live spec: _spec/packages/starchess-core/sc-moves.puml
'            _spec/packages/starchess-core/turn-queue-sequence.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Backlog "saves CC" misread Command Center / a command counter.
' Cost is vespene (""SPECIAL_ENERGY_COST""). B ""pawnDouble"" occupies;
' C classical is the optional extra rank, not a second special tax.
title OUTDATED — B pawnDouble already occupies;\ndo not invent a CC join

component "pawnDouble.ts" as PD <<app>>
component "B pawnDouble\noccupies +1" as B <<app>>
component "C classical\noptional extra rank" as C <<app>>
component "vespene cost 1" as GAS <<db>>
component "**second CC spend**\nwrong token, wrong tax" as TAX <<error>>

PD ARROW_MAIN B
B ARROW_OPTIONAL C
GAS ARROW_MAIN B
B ARROW_ERROR TAX : do not replan

note bottom of B
  **""pawnGasStacks"" already emits
  B ""pawnDouble"" then C classical.**
  Collision with friends stays a
  separate resolve rule.
end note

note right of TAX
  **CC in this tree is the Command
  Center.** Re-planning this item as
  a command-counter join will fight
  the live special registry.
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Open ""sc-moves.puml"" /
  ""turn-queue-sequence.puml"". Any new
  gas rule starts from ""pawnDouble"",
  not from this backlog sentence.
end legend
@enduml
